[2026-11-07T20:35:29.965-08:00] ## Ubuntu distribution repository
[2026-11-07T20:35:29.965-08:00] ##
[2026-11-07T20:35:29.965-08:00] ## The following settings can be adjusted to configure which packages to use from Ubuntu.
[2026-11-07T20:35:29.965-08:00] ## Mirror your choices (except for URIs and Suites) in the security section below to
[2026-11-07T20:35:29.981-08:00] ## ensure timely security updates.
[2026-11-07T20:35:29.981-08:00] ##
[2026-11-07T20:35:29.981-08:00] ## Types: Append deb-src to enable the fetching of source package.
[2026-11-07T20:35:29.981-08:00] ## URIs: A URL to the repository (you may add multiple URLs)
[2026-11-07T20:35:29.997-08:00] ## Suites: The following additional suites can be configured
[2026-11-07T20:35:29.997-08:00] ##   <name>-updates   - Major bug fix updates produced after the final release of the
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.013-08:00] ##                      distribution.
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.013-08:00] ##   <name>-backports - software from this repository may not have been tested as
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.013-08:00] ##                      extensively as that contained in the main release, although it includes
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.029-08:00] ##                      newer versions of some applications which may provide useful features.
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.029-08:00] ##                      Also, please note that software in backports WILL NOT receive any review
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.045-08:00] ##                      or updates from the Ubuntu security team.
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.045-08:00] ## Components: Aside from main, the following components can be added to the list
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.045-08:00] ##   restricted  - Software that may not be under a free license, or protected by patents.
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.061-08:00] ##   universe    - Community maintained packages. Software in this repository receives maintenance
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.061-08:00] ##                 from volunteers in the Ubuntu community, or a 10 year security maintenance
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.077-08:00] ##                 commitment from Canonical when an Ubuntu Pro subscription is attached.
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.077-08:00] ##   multiverse  - Community maintained of restricted. Software from this repository is
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.093-08:00] ##                 ENTIRELY UNSUPPORTED by the Ubuntu team, and may not be under a free
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.093-08:00] ##                 licence. Please satisfy yourself as to your rights to use the software.
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.109-08:00] ##                 Also, please note that software in multiverse WILL NOT receive any
[2026-11-07T20:35:30.109-08:00] ##                 review or updates from the Ubuntu security team.
